Indicator 1.2.A: Number of mechanisms and processes in place for engagement of the public/civil society organizations in the work of Parliament.
Indicator 1.2.B: Number of non-governmental/civil society organization recommendations adopted by Parliamentary mechanisms, with the support of UNDP
Indicator 1.2.C: Percentage of gender related recommendations adopted by parliamentary mechanisms, with the support of UNDP.</narrative>
